{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cc85ff4f-5d6e-44c1-a7e3-e4a9a68a81ee",
    "name": "CoffeNChill",
    "description": "Every request sends x-functions-key: {{functionKey}} (collection-level auth).\nImport docs/CoffeNChill.local.postman_environment.json and select the 'CoffeNChill Local' environment.\nSwitch baseUrl to http://localhost:7053 to hit the app running in Visual Studio instead of Docker.\n\nPart 2: the Orders folder puts an order on order-processing-queue and then checks its status in the Orders table (Received -> Preparing -> Ready -> Collected). Run 'Place Order' first, it saves the orderId for the status requests.",
